                                "sense_id": "7f3a6549-f5d4-3ae3-90d6-69bbbf8cd68f",
                                "text": "The decluttering trend is nothing new, and has much to recommend it, but every week now seems to bring a fresh example of what ascetics might once have called the renunciation of possessions […]."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b4d15d3d-fac2-49f1-a135-4681dc0e72ca",
                                "sense_id": "7f3a6549-f5d4-3ae3-90d6-69bbbf8cd68f",
                                "text": "Decluttering is an act of compassion—for yourself and for others, because it frees you from draining influences so you can give yourself over fully to what you love and care for."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
